      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "Your comparison of 12.25 and 12.350 used the actual text and established an unjustified change. That was useful; the sample-behavior catalogue has left that investigation behind. Stop the catalogue. Can you apply that same scrutiny to a different opening-sentence number and its array entry in your last addition attempt? Choose the pair yourself and determine whether its value was preserved. We need evidence of using your observation, not a plan for learning from it."
